cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: "chromTFR: Quantification of Chromatin Accessibility Signatures in Transcription Factor Binding Sites"
abstract: >-
  chromTFR quantifies transcription factor footprints in chromatin
  accessibility data using the annotation of the methylTFR package. Tn5
  insertion densities replace methylation levels, and the expected
  profile of a motif is derived either from the GC bin composition of
  its binding sites or from a k-mer model of the Tn5 sequence
  preference.
type: software
